IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `vea-guide`

-- Veterans' Entitlements Act 1986 with the Approved Guide (Table 23.1) and the s 37AA Determination 2023 -- worked cases,
-- from the veteran's seat.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were read by hand from
-- the deposited texts (Table 23.1 as transcribed in F2016L01332.tables.md; the Determination's s 7), never copied from the
-- encoding's output. No scenario life raised this; the facts, and the pension rates in force (inputs, not the printed
-- figures), are the encoder's, HYPOTHETICAL throughout.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Rounding to the nearest five points.
#ASSERT `What is my rounded impairment rating` 52 EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `What is my rounded impairment rating` 53 EQUALS 55
#ASSERT `What is my rounded impairment rating` 2 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is my rounded impairment rating` 67 EQUALS 65

-- Table 23.1. Ray: combined impairment 52 (row 50), lifestyle 4: 90%. Impairment 32 (row 30), lifestyle 2: 50%. Impairment 12
-- (row 10), lifestyle 6: 60%. Impairment 0, lifestyle 0: 0%. Impairment 70, lifestyle 0: 100%.
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 52 4 EQUALS `my degree of incapacity is` 90
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 32 2 EQUALS `my degree of incapacity is` 50
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 12 6 EQUALS `my degree of incapacity is` 60
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 0 0 EQUALS `my degree of incapacity is` 0
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 70 0 EQUALS `my degree of incapacity is` 100
-- N/A cells: impairment 38 (row 40) with lifestyle 0; impairment 0 with lifestyle 5.
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 38 0 EQUALS `Table 23.1 gives no degree for that impairment and lifestyle rating (N/A): the lifestyle rating is not one the Guide allows with that impairment rating`
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 0 5 EQUALS `Table 23.1 gives no degree for that impairment and lifestyle rating (N/A): the lifestyle rating is not one the Guide allows with that impairment rating`
-- Outside the table: impairment 93 (row 95); lifestyle 8.
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 93 3 EQUALS `not covered: Table 23.1 has no row for an impairment rating above 90, or the lifestyle rating is not 0 to 7`
#ASSERT `What is my degree of incapacity under Table 23.1` 20 8 EQUALS `not covered: Table 23.1 has no row for an impairment rating above 90, or the lifestyle rating is not 0 to 7`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The rate from the ratings (rates in force HYPOTHETICAL: general $400, EDA $540, intermediate $650, special $1,700).
-- Ray, 70, ratings 52 and 4: 90% of the general rate, $360, no work tests met.
#ASSERT `What rate of disability pension do my ratings give me` 52 4 FALSE `more than that` FALSE TRUE FALSE 70 400 540 650 1700 EQUALS `my rate is` (`the general rate pension (s 22(2)): my degree of incapacity as a percentage of the general rate, per fortnight` 360)
-- Ivan, a Vietnam veteran, 58, ratings 72 and 5: 100%; his incapacity alone stopped his work and he can work no more than 8
-- hours a week; claimed before 65: the special (TPI) rate.
#ASSERT `What rate of disability pension do my ratings give me` 72 5 FALSE `no more than 8 hours a week, because of my war-caused incapacity alone` TRUE TRUE FALSE 58 400 540 650 1700 EQUALS `my rate is` (`the special rate (s 24), per fortnight` 1700)
-- Joe, 70, ratings 73 (rounded 75) and 6, no work tests: 100%, impairment 75 and lifestyle 6: the EDA rate.
#ASSERT `What rate of disability pension do my ratings give me` 73 6 FALSE `more than that` FALSE TRUE FALSE 70 400 540 650 1700 EQUALS `my rate is` (`the extreme disablement adjustment rate (s 22(4)), per fortnight` 540)
-- An N/A combination: no degree, so no rate.
#ASSERT `What rate of disability pension do my ratings give me` 38 0 FALSE `more than that` FALSE TRUE FALSE 70 400 540 650 1700 EQUALS `no degree of incapacity: Table 23.1 gives none for these ratings (N/A), or they are outside the table`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- s 37AA Determination 2023 s 7. On the special rate: (a). Blind in both eyes: (a). An impairment rated 45 that permanently
-- stops work over 8 hours a week, the Commission satisfied: (b). The same without the Commission's satisfaction: no. Covered
-- by the 2013 Determination before 15 September 2023: yes (s 6). Nothing: no.
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: I am permanently incapacitated for work under s 7(a) of the 2023 Determination (blindness, the special rate, an MRCA Special Rate Disability Pension, or the MRCC's s 199(1) satisfaction)`
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: I am permanently incapacitated for work under s 7(a) of the 2023 Determination (blindness, the special rate, an MRCA Special Rate Disability Pension, or the MRCC's s 199(1) satisfaction)`
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes: I am permanently incapacitated for work under s 7(b) of the 2023 Determination (an impairment rated 40 or more that permanently stops me working more than 8 hours a week)`
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: none of the circumstances in s 7 of the 2023 Determination applies to me`
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `yes: I was permanently incapacitated for work under the 2013 Determination, so I am taken to be under the 2023 Determination (s 6)`
#ASSERT `Am I permanently incapacitated for work under the s 37AA determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: none of the circumstances in s 7 of the 2023 Determination applies to me`

-- Invalidity service pension. Ivan, an Australian veteran with qualifying service, on the special rate: eligible. Without the
-- special rate and with no s 7 circumstance: not eligible.
#ASSERT `Am I eligible for the invalidity service pension, with s 37AA worked out` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `an Australian veteran (Australian Defence Force or Australian mariner)` FALSE 40 40 FALSE
#ASSERT (NOT `Am I eligible for the invalidity service pension, with s 37AA worked out` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `an Australian veteran (Australian Defence Force or Australian mariner)` FALSE 40 40 FALSE)
